    "rated_by": "readiness",
    "rationale": "Medium. The work is on a shared renderer (`features/work-item/**`, touched by F-09, F-14, F-16, F-17) and a proposed v7 contract (D-LINE-WORKSPACE) that the backend may change. The review state includes \"Approve and send\", which sends to a client (INV-RESEND, effect_uncertain). It stays at medium because all of it is on the mock, the send is unimplemented in the backend, and nothing is released. SURFACES: ui (8 boards), api (E-WORK-STEP, E-WORK-ITEM workspace), contract-change (proposed block), external-messaging (client report send and uncertain-effect handling). PRODUCT-ACCEPTANCE is not-required because the work conforms to the client-approved boards. The business rules (four cited parts, PMO Lead review, exact version sent) are already on the boards and in screens.md."
